  "details": "- CVE-2026-90616: flatpak_ensure_data_dir and flatpak_run_setup_base_argv\n  resolved the app data subdirectories by path, so an app could replace them\n  with symlinks between runs and have them followed during the next sandbox\n  setup; both now resolve them with glnx_chase_and_mkdirat()/glnx_chaseat()\n  confined beneath the app data directory\n- Update the bundled libglnx with the glnx_chaseat API the above fix needs\n- Carry the upstream regression test for the above fix",
